  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>BAR MANAGER</strong></p><p><br>​<strong>Mission:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Responsible for the bar outlets during their time slot, leading the operations of the assigned consumption centers, ensuring good management and customer experience.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>What will you have to do?</strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Manage daily operations of the bar outlets.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Oversee daily and monthly inventory of glassware, dishware, cutlery, and decorations.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ensure accurate reporting of inventory and department performance.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Supervise preventive maintenance and deep cleaning of bar equipment.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Manage menus, liquor lists, and department promotions.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ensure proper operation of bar machines and equipment.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ensure compliance with hygiene, safety, and company standards.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Monitor department budget and financial results.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Help with the training and development of staff.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Maintain excellent customer service and personalize guest experiences.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Handle customer complaints and escalate issues when needed.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Be aware of hotel services, entertainment, and events, and keep the team informed.<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>What we are looking for?</strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Higher degree and/or university degree, preferably Tourism or Hospitality, or similar.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Albanian and advanced English, a third language will be highly valuable.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Knowledge of the F&amp;B area, both the waiting service (restaurant) and the bar.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Knowledge of cashiers' closing and reconciliation, stock management, and ordering.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Knowledge of the latest bars trends.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ability to ensure health and safety procedures (HACCP).</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Cost control/ management.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Knowledge of REVO, and POS management.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Advanced command of the Office 365 package</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Knowledge of hotel operations.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ability to work in a team, service and quality oriented, professionalism, global and strategic vision and communication and influence as key competencies. Creativity and innovation.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; At least 1-2 years’ experience in a similar position, in the sector.</p>",
